{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras/libraryHero.png?t=1748373565\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of two penguins, Flare and Breeze, far from their icy home, as they journey through a blooming springtime world in this charming pixel art puzzle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Springuins</i>, you control Flare\u2014but when you collect a cherry blossom, Breeze wants to follow its scent for a few precious steps, synchronizing their movement. Use this mechanic to navigate tight puzzles and reunite the pair across vibrant, handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras/Screenshot_2025-05-22_at_12.11.10\u202fPM.png?t=1748373565\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique one-controls-two puzzle mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bite-sized levels full of clever movement challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute retro-style pixel art with a charming color palette.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cozy soundtrack to waddle along with.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you bring Flare and Breeze together?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644860?t=1748373565","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/57986f7561523b95db8546ca085e3a6e18f131a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748373565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/f4e63193cf0320fb3559412107851e9403538482/capsu